# .memory — operational pick-up state (rewritten 2026-08-28 afternoon)

Fast orientation for a session that has lost context. The *scientific*
ledger is `docs/STATUS.md` (chronological, authoritative on findings and
deviations); this file is how to RUN things and what is in flight.
Registered documents override both: `PREREGISTRATION.md` + addenda 1–3
(hashes in their commits), `docs/PRIOR-ART.md`, `docs/GRID.md`.

